# Header keamanan dasar (Fase 3, PRD bagian 4). Format `_headers` dipakai
# Cloudflare Pages dan Netlify. Hosting belum dipilih (P-006): bila memakai
# layanan lain, pasang header yang sama lewat konfigurasi layanan itu.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
